WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,700
Isn't this Ma Liming's wife? Don't mention what happened to her?

2
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,540
She went to sea with Ma Liming early this morning

3
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:11,220
Ma Liming was caught in the fishing net for some unknown reason.

4
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,420
Fell directly into the sea

5
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,620
This woman can't even sail a boat

6
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:15,860
Later, we happened to meet a fisherman from our village.

7
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:17,580
Help her tow the boat back

8
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,460
When you go fishing, you are afraid of being caught in a fishing net.

9
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,820
Ma Liming was also careless

10
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,540
Going out to fish is a refugee exchange for money.

11
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,500
Every year nearby fish people

12
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,540
All were buried in the sea

13
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,820
Some people do it because of the weather

14
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:26,980
Swept into the sea by the strong wind

15
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,180
But a lot of it is due to carelessness

16
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,540
Just like Ma Liming

17
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:34,540
My brother fell into the water from a fishing net and died.

18
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,340
Isn’t that boat of yours only capable of rocking?

19
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:38,220
That thing is too inefficient. Let me tell you.

20
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:40,380
Why don't you buy the Ma family's boat?

21
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:42,740
Installing a diesel engine will only make the ship sail faster

22
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:44,140
Machine trawling is not possible

23
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:45,580
Still need manpower to cast the net

24
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:46,620
As long as manpower is needed to cast the net

25
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:48,180
There is a possibility of being caught in a fishing net

26
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,900
Want to completely avoid this problem

27
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,860
The only option is to buy a tin boat that can trawl nets

28
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:53,020
reborn

29
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:54,980
I want to make amends with my family

30
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:56,380
The prerequisite for making up for it is

31
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:57,780
Let yourself be safe first

32
00:00:57,780 --> 00:00:59,300
Although the money I paid from selling fish twice combined

33
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:01,980
But if you really want to buy a tin boat

34
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:02,940
Just like

35
00:01:02,940 --> 00:01:04,220
interest free loan
